register this worktree, start its services, and run its hooks

Usage:
  treerig up [services...] [flags]

Flags:
      --config string                 path to treerig.toml (default: nearest
                                      above cwd)
  -h, --help                          help for up
      --reallocate-port stringArray   move a routed service to a new loopback
                                      port (repeatable)

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto or plain (one line per
                        change) (default "auto")
